Decision Workbench uses LangGraph (MIT) for its graph runtime.

The optional local model adapter uses DecisionTune 1.0 and decision-tune==1.0.0,
published by DecisionTune / hotin.ai under Apache-2.0.
Model: https://huggingface.co/decision-tune/decisiontune-1.0
Implementation: https://github.com/decision-tune/decision-tune
DecisionTune is based on answerdotai/ModernBERT-large. Its model card documents
additional training-data attribution and provenance limits. Model weights and
upstream implementation files are not redistributed in this repository.

Jev is a TypeSafe product. This independent study is not affiliated with TypeSafe
or DecisionTune and does not claim their names, benchmarks or training work.
